OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBlustery
OL,6,Fshowers will affect northern and some
OL,7,Fwestern areas this evening. Both the
OL,8,Fshowers and gusty winds will generally
OL,9,Fease overnight, though North Sea
OL,10,Fcoasts could also catch a shower
OL,11,Flater. Elsewhere clear spells, and
OL,12,Fturning chilly in rural areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FThe odd shower will affect
OL,15,Fthe far west of the UK and some North
OL,16,FSea coasts on Wednesday, especially
OL,17,Fduring the morning. Otherwise it looks
OL,18,Ffine with some sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
